- Collect **all** fragments before solving; missing one fails the attempt.
- It’s **5-SAT / CNF** — use a real SAT solver (kissat / cadical / pysat), don’t brute-force.
- Submit an assignment of exactly `n_vars` characters of only `0` and `1`.
- Hard instances may not finish before the deadline — start a **new attempt** instead of forcing one puzzle forever.
- Prefer a solver portfolio (multiple seeds) and exclusive CPU while solving.
